## Структура репозиторію (ключові директорії)

```
app/
  controllers/api/v1/   # тонкі контролери
  services/             # вся бізнес-логіка
    silken_net/         # Lorenz attractor, GeoUtils
    blockchain_*/       # minting, burning, rollback
    iotex/, chainlink/, peaq/, solana/, celo/, ethereum/
    filecoin/, streamr/, toucan/, klima_dao/, polygon/
    dclimate/           # satellite fire verification
  workers/              # Sidekiq workers
  views/
    components/         # domain Phlex components
    shared/ui/          # StatusBadge, StatCard, DataTable, Pagination...
    shared/iot/         # MetricValue
    shared/web3/        # Address
  javascript/controllers/ # Stimulus

firmware/
  soldier/main.c        # 648 lines, STM32WLE5JC
  queen/main.c          # 550 lines, STM32WLE5JC + SIM7070G
  bio_contracts/        # mruby Lorenz attractor
  test/                 # host-based tests (137 total)

docs/                   # SSOT архітектурні документи
terraform/              # GCP infrastructure
deploy/akash/           # Akash SDL manifests
subgraph/               # The Graph (polygon-amoy)
contracts/              # Solidity SCC/SFC/Governance (Polygon)
  test/                 # Foundry test suites (*.t.sol)
```

